{"repositoryId":1075908750,"availability":"available","full":"thustorage/RoundPipe","name":"RoundPipe","description":"Large DNNs training framework for consumer GPUs","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":94,"forks":14,"created":"2025-10-14T06:41:53Z","updated":"2026-07-05T17:17:07Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://thustorage.github.io/RoundPipe/","topics":[],"demo":"https://thustorage.github.io/RoundPipe/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T05:06:59.110Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T05:06:59.110Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T05:06:59.110Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T05:06:59.110Z","stars":94,"forks":14}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["High Performance · Easy to Use · Built for Gaming GPUs","RoundPipe is a large DNN training framework that lets you train huge models on consumer-grade GPUs. On a single 24 GB GPU, you can full fine-tune 32B-parameter models, LoRA fine-tune up to 235B, and handle 64K+ token sequences, with throughput approaching datacenter-class hardware."],"features":["Train bigger than ever: Full fine-tune 32B models or LoRA fine-tune up to 235B on a single 24 GB GPU. Up to 7× longer sequence length than PyTorch FSDP.","High performance: Push a 4090 close to A800 NVLINK-class throughput. Up to 6× faster than FSDP Offload in typical workloads.","Linear multi-GPU scaling: Scale to multiple GPUs within a node without rewriting your training loop. Throughput grows linearly while max sequence length per GPU stays unchanged.","Feels like PyTorch: Sequential programming interface with a low learning curve. Works well in Jupyter Notebook for rapid iteration.","General by design: No constraints on layer structure, training flow, or parameter update strategy."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/thustorage/RoundPipe/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ce727a2990c69bee683dcdf1bcc30c27a2bd848c97c9c023cdec5a1a5be48b67","extractedAt":"2026-10